---
---
<section class="sustainability-section">
  <div class="sustainability-container">
    
    <div class="sustainability-header">
      <div class="tagline">100% Indigenous</div>
      <h2 class="title">Soil-first authenticity</h2>
      <p class="desc">
        Pure yields sourced ethically.<br/>
        Completely indigenous — no shortcuts taken,<br/>
        and zero synthetic interference. Ever.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3 class="stat-title">Average<br>age of<br>soil</h3>
        <p class="stat-desc">The Western Ghats are older than the Himalayas — older than most mountain ranges on earth. The soil holds memory.</p>
        <div class="stat-value">25M</div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3 class="stat-title">Harvest<br>cycles</h3>
        <p class="stat-desc">Each harvest follows the natural monsoon rhythm — no forcing, no accelerating. The season decides.</p>
        <div class="stat-value">100%</div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3 class="stat-title">Pesticides<br>used</h3>
        <p class="stat-desc">Zero synthetic chemicals. No exceptions. What goes into the soil comes back to you — we take that seriously.</p>
        <div class="stat-value">0%</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sustainability-section {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) var(--space-xl);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .sustainability-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sustainability-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-title);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: var(--line-height-tight);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg) 0;
    color: var(--color-warm-cream);
  }

  .desc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
    color: rgba(235, 229, 217, 0.7);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .stat-item {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(198, 156, 82, 0.3);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .stat-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-title);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg) 0;
    color: var(--color-warm-cream);
  }

  .stat-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(235, 229, 217, 0.6);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2xl) 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-4xl);
    }
  }
</style>
